            fireballDice: "The attacker rolls its [AP] and the defender its [DP]. The dice are sorted from high to low and compared in pairs (the card under the struck unit): a higher attack die deals 1 damage, a [tie goes to the defense], and an attack die left without a pair deals 1, except a [1]. Here: 5 against 5 was blocked, 4 beat 2, the 1 was left over. Each skeleton had 1 HP: both fell, two points for you.",
